207
00:11:17,759 --> 00:11:18,919
A high ponytail,

208
00:11:19,279 --> 00:11:20,679
and a poker face when angry.

209
00:11:22,679 --> 00:11:23,799
Yue Xuan.

210
00:11:24,799 --> 00:11:25,279
Yes.

211
00:11:26,039 --> 00:11:27,279
It's like

212
00:11:27,279 --> 00:11:28,000
