I want it.

222
00:12:08,759 --> 00:12:11,000
Our prince is not only a good general,

223
00:12:11,720 --> 00:12:12,840
but also a good riddle master.

224
00:12:13,399 --> 00:12:14,360
It's a piece of cake for him.

225
00:12:15,559 --> 00:12:15,919
Let's go.

226
00:12:17,039 --> 00:12:17,720
Let's go.

227
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:21,399
Wood above the tune, not the building.

228
00:12:21,679 --> 00:12:24,080
Moved to a tall tree, yet hard to come.

229
00:12:24,720 --> 00:12:25,840
Moved to a tall tree,

230
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:27,840
