260
00:14:03,919 --> 00:14:05,159
[We've kissed so many times.]

261
00:14:05,759 --> 00:14:07,000
[Why am I still so easily blushing?]

262
00:14:08,720 --> 00:14:09,240
I...

263
00:14:11,200 --> 00:14:12,200
Mr. Bupian is good at

264
00:14:12,240 --> 00:14:13,200
