268
00:14:18,440 --> 00:14:19,399
Bupian?

269
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:21,840
Let's go and see.

270
00:14:22,519 --> 00:14:22,840
Go.

271
00:14:25,120 --> 00:14:26,320
Please give me your birth date.

272
00:15:06,639 --> 00:15:07,960
Your destiny,

273
00:15:08,519 --> 00:15:09,360
