274
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:11,440
Destined for greatness,

275
00:15:11,519 --> 00:15:12,360
with a noble future ahead.

276
00:15:12,639 --> 00:15:14,360
Yet, a solitary star looms overhead,

277
00:15:15,159 --> 00:15:16,519
signaling a separation of soul and fate.

278
00:15:18,840 --> 00:15:20,080
Your destiny,

279
00:15:20,919 --> 00:15:22,320
is marked by dual shadows,

280
00:15:22,559 --> 00:15:23,639
like a rootless duckweed.

281
00:15:24,960 --> 00:15:26,279
The destinies of both of you

282
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:29,919
are in conflict and opposition.

283
00:15:31,200 --> 00:15:32,600
If you insist on being together,

284
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:33,919
