285
00:15:34,960 --> 00:15:36,919
may be one death and one injury.

286
00:15:39,759 --> 00:15:40,759
I'm so foolish.

287
00:15:41,399 --> 00:15:42,600
Your Highness's soul is about to disperse,

288
00:15:42,600 --> 00:15:43,440
and I didn't even notice

289
00:15:44,120 --> 00:15:45,519
such a crucial matter.

290
00:15:46,159 --> 00:15:47,559
If it weren't for Lady Feng,

291
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:49,960
I... I'm truly useless.

292
00:15:51,320 --> 00:15:51,799
Let's go.

293
00:15:53,200 --> 00:15:53,799
Be gentle.

